OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 11 MAR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Music Rediscovered -
OL,5,     Fseries 2
OL,6,     GThe Comet Prelude received its
OL,7,     Gworld premiere recording in 2025,
OL,8,     Gseventy-three years after it was
OL,9,     Gwritten by the mixed-race
OL,10,     Gcomposer Avril Coleridge-Taylor.
OL,11,     GLeah Broad explores why.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
